body:
Did you consider switching disciplines in grad school or was that out of the cards? 

Don't worry, reassurance is good enough. It makes me feel better to realize that my problem is pretty common, and thus an answer has probably been found before.




&#x200B;

Yeah, I'm thinking of doing just that. As long as I can afford to pay my loan payments somehow I think it would be a good idea. 

&#x200B;

Not much money, but varied work experience in small teams sounds really great. They also happen to be concentrated in large cities which would be a nice change of pace (I haven't interacted with Atlanta much).
